the restriction of\n<MATH_0014> to <MATH_0015>, see\nSites, Lemma <REF_0002>).\nBy More on Morphisms, Lemma\n<REF_0003>\nevery object <MATH_0016> of <MATH_0017> has an <ACCENT_0003>tale covering\n<MATH_0018> such that the discussion in the previous\nparagraph applies to <MATH_0019>. The lemma follows.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b32a97ca6fb9f2b01fcd0ace4ca0a06dbeb2593d0093d99787f52618cd05349f", "unit_id": "tag:0EYR:proof"}
